 yii.','Manage Series Issues'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Isoro Jara','Move up'=>'Gbe soke','Move down'=>'Gbe silẹ','Move up: %s'=>'Gbe soke: %s','Move down: %s'=>'Gbe silẹ: %s','%1$s moved to position %2$d of %3$d.'=>'%1$s ti gbe si ipo %2$d ti %3$d.','Order changed. Save to keep the new order.'=>'Iṣẹ́ àṣẹ ti yipada. Fipamọ́ láti pa àṣẹ tuntun mọ́.','Number of items per page'=>'Iye awọn nkan fun oju-iwe','Publishing Series:'=>'Ṣiṣẹda Jara:','Search results for &#8220;%s&#8221;'=>'Awọn abajade wiwa fun &#8220;%s&#8221;','Search'=>'Wa','Publication Date/Time:'=>'Ọjọ/Àkókò Ifiṣootọ:','Month'=>'Osu','Day'=>'Ọjọ','Year'=>'Ọdun','Hour'=>'Wakati','Minute'=>'Iṣẹju','Update Order'=>'Ṣatunkọ Ẹlẹsẹ','Series Order:'=>'Ẹlẹsẹ Iru:','Drag the post names into the order you want them to be in the series, from the first part to the last part.'=>'Fa awọn orukọ ifiṣootọ sinu aṣẹ ti o fẹ ki wọn wa ninu ẹlẹsẹ, lati apakan akọkọ si apakan ikẹhin.','Search Posts'=>'Wa Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ','Order Tools'=>'Ṣeto Awọn Ọpa','Automatically reorder this series by publication date.'=>'Ṣeto aifọwọyi lẹsẹsẹ yii nipasẹ ọjọ atẹjade.','Order by publication date: Oldest first'=>'Ṣeto nipasẹ ọjọ atẹjade: Atijọ ni akọkọ','Order by publication date: Newest first'=>'Ṣeto nipasẹ ọjọ atẹjade: Tuntun ni akọkọ','Unpublished posts in series:'=>'Awọn ifiṣootọ ti ko tii tẹjade ninu ẹlẹsẹ:','When these posts are published, they will be added after the last current post in the series.'=>'Nigbati awọn ifiṣootọ wọnyi ba tẹjade, wọn yoo wa ni afikun lẹhin ifiṣootọ lọwọlọwọ ti o kẹhin ninu ẹlẹsẹ.','Unpublished Posts'=>'Awọn Ifiṣootọ Ti Ko Ti Tẹjade','Publish Unpublished Posts'=>'Tẹjade Awọn Ifiṣootọ Ti Ko Ti Tẹjade','Unpublished Series Order'=>'Aṣẹ Ẹlẹsẹ Ti Ko Ti Tẹjade','PublishPress Series API key'=>'PublishPress Series API bọtini','Dismiss upgrade notice'=>'Kọ nipa ifitonileti imudojuiwọn','Dismiss'=>'Kọ','PublishPress Series Add-on licensing has changed. This notice only appears on sites affected by this change. You can %s.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ afikun PublishPress Series ti yipada. Iwe iroyin yii nikan ni a fihan lori awọn aaye ti o ni ipa nipasẹ iyipada yii. O le %s.','read more about this licensing change'=>'ka siwaju sii nipa iyipada iwe-aṣẹ yii','PublishPress Series Plugin Options'=>'Àwọn aṣayan Plugin Ẹlẹsẹ PublishPress','Series settings'=>'Awọn eto Series','Update Options'=>'Awọn aṣayan imudojuiwọn','Reset Series settings'=>'Tun awọn eto Series ṣe','Clicking Yes will reset the options to the defaults and you will lose all customizations. Or you can click cancel and return.'=>'Tite Yes yoo tun awọn aṣayan pada si awọn aiyipada ati pe iwọ yoo padanu gbogbo awọn aṣa. Tabi o le tẹ ipinnu ati pada.','No'=>'Bẹẹkọ','Yes'=>'Bẹẹni','Allowed Html'=>'Html ti a gba laaye','Overview'=>'Akopọ','The following is a legend of the tokens that are available for use in the custom template fields. These will be replaced with the appropriate values when the plugin runs.'=>'Eyi ni itumọ ti awọn ami ti o wa fun lilo ninu awọn aaye apẹrẹ aṣa. Awọn wọnyi yoo wa ni rọpo pẹlu awọn iye to yẹ nigbati plugin naa ba ṣiṣẹ.','This will be replaced with the series featured image for a series.'=>'Eyi yoo rọpo pẹlu aworan ti a ṣe afihan fun jara kan.','Same as %series_icon% except that the series featured image will be linked to the series page'=>'Kò yàtọ si %series_icon% ayafi pe aworan ti a ṣe afihan fun jara yoo jẹ asopọ si oju-iwe jara.','This token is for use with the orgSeries widget only - it references where you want the list of series titles to be inserted and requires that the template for each series title be also set.'=>'Ami yii jẹ fun lilo pẹlu widget orgSeries nikan - o tọka si ibiti o fẹ ki atokọ awọn akọle ẹlẹsẹ ti wa ni ifọwọsi ati pe o nilo pe aṣẹ fun ọkọọkan akọle ẹlẹsẹ naa tun jẹ seti.','This will be replaced with the title of a series'=>'Eyi yoo wa ni rọpo pẹlu akọle ẹlẹsẹ kan','Same as %series_title% except that it will also be linked to the series page'=>'Bii %series_title% ayafi pe yoo tun jẹ asopọ si oju-iwe ẹlẹsẹ','Is the location token for where the contents of the post list post templates will appear.'=>'Ipo ti aami fun ibi ti akoonu ti awọn àtẹjáde akojọpọ ifiweranṣẹ yoo han.','Is the location token for where the contents of the post list post templates will appear and use provided widget post short title.'=>'Ipo ti aami fun ibi ti akoonu ti awọn àtẹjáde akojọpọ ifiweranṣẹ yoo han ati lo akọle kukuru àtẹjáde ti a pese.','Will be replaced with the post title of a post in the series'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu akọle ifiweranṣẹ ti ifiweranṣẹ kan ninu jara','Will be replaced with the post title of a post in the series linked to the page view of that post.'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu akọle ifiweranṣẹ ti ifiweranṣẹ kan ninu jara ti o ni asopọ si wiwo oju-iwe ti ifiweranṣẹ yẹn.','Will be replaced with the post title short of a post in the series'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu akọle kukuru ifiweranṣẹ ti ifiweranṣẹ kan ninu jara','Will be replaced with the post title short of a post in the series linked to the page view of that post.'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu akọle kukuru ifiweranṣẹ ti ifiweranṣẹ kan ninu jara ti o ni asopọ si wiwo oju-iwe ti ifiweranṣẹ yẹn.','Will be replaced by the navigation link for the previous post in a series. The text will be whatever is included in the \'Custom Previous Post Navigation Text\' field. If that field is empty then the text will be the title of the post'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu ọna asopọ lilọ fun ifiweranṣẹ ti tẹlẹ ninu jara. Ọrọ naa yoo jẹ ohun gbogbo ti a fi sinu aaye \'Ọrọ Lilọ Ifiweranṣẹ Tẹlẹ Sọtọ\'. Ti aaye yẹn ba ṣofo, lẹhinna ọrọ naa yoo jẹ akọle ifiweranṣẹ naa','Will be replaced by the navigation link for the next post in a series. The text will be whatever is included in the \'Custom Next Post Navigation Text\' field. If that field is empty then the text will be the title of the post'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu ọna asopọ lilọ fun ifiweranṣẹ ti n bọ ninu jara. Ọrọ naa yoo jẹ ohun gbogbo ti a fi sinu aaye \'Ọrọ Lilọ Ifiweranṣẹ Tẹlẹ Sọtọ\'. Ti aaye yẹn ba ṣofo, lẹhinna ọrọ naa yoo jẹ akọle ifiweranṣẹ naa','Will be replaced by the navigation link for the first post in a series. The text will be whatever is included in the \'Custom First Post Navigation Text\' field. If that field is empty then the text will be the title of the post'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu ọna asopọ lilọ fun ifiweranṣẹ akọkọ ninu jara. Ọrọ naa yoo jẹ ohun gbogbo ti a fi sinu aaye \'Ọrọ Lilọ Ifiweranṣẹ Kọ́kọ́ Sọtọ\'. Ti aaye yẹn ba ṣofo, lẹhinna ọrọ naa yoo jẹ akọle ifiweranṣẹ naa','Use this tag either before or after the rest of the template code.  It will indicate where you want the content of a post to display.'=>'Lo aami yii boya ṣaaju tabi lẹhin iyoku koodu àtẹjáde. Yoo tọka ibi ti o fẹ ki akoonu ifiweranṣẹ han.','Will display what part of a series the post is'=>'Yoo fihan iru apakan jara ti ifiweranṣẹ jẹ','Will display the total number of posts in a series'=>'Yoo fihan nọmba lapapọ ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ninu jara','Will display the description for the series'=>'Yoo fihan apejuwe fun jara','Will output the slug of the series'=>'Yoo funni ni slug ti jara','Will output the ID of the series'=>'Yoo funni ni ID ti jara','Will output the author of the post'=>'Yoo funni ni onkọwe ifiweranṣẹ naa','If the post has a feature-image then that image will be displayed'=>'Ti ifiweranṣẹ ba ni aworan ẹya, lẹhinna aworan yẹn yoo han','The date that a post was published'=>'Ọjọ ti ifiweranṣẹ kan ti wa ni atẹjade','Will be replaced with the unpublished post title of a post in the series'=>'A yoo rọpo rẹ pẹlu akọle ifiweranṣẹ ti ko tẹjade ti ifiweranṣẹ kan ninu jara','Will display the total number of published and unpublished posts in a series'=>'Yoo fihan nọmba lapapọ ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade ati ti ko tẹjade ninu jara','Please update your PublishPress Series data'=>'Jọwọ mu data PublishPress Series rẹ pọ si','We have made changes to how series are stored and this requires a small update. This improves support for the Multiple Series feature, and resolves some issues with the order of posts. Please click this button to upgrade.'=>'A ti ṣe awọn ayipada si bi awọn jara ti wa ni fipamọ ati eyi nilo imudojuiwọn kekere kan. Eyi mu atilẹyin fun ẹya Multiple Series pọ si, ati pe o yanju diẹ ninu awọn iṣoro pẹlu ìtòsọna awọn ifiweranṣẹ. Jọwọ tẹ bọtini yii lati ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Update Series data'=>'Mudarasi data Series','Series upgrade completed.'=>'Imudojuiwọn jara ti pari.','Series order sync completed. %d posts updated.'=>'Iṣọpọ ìtòsọna jara ti pari. %d awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ni imudojuiwọn.','Search Series'=>'Wa Jara','Popular Series'=>'Awọn Jara Olokiki','All Series'=>'Gbogbo Awọn Jara','Edit Series'=>'Ṣatunkọ Jara','Update Series'=>'Mudarasi Jara','Add New Series'=>'Fi Jara Tuntun Kun','New Series Name'=>'Orukọ Jara Tuntun','No series found'=>'Ko si jara ti a rii','%1$s series migrated from "%2$s" to "%3$s" taxonomy. Settings updated.'=>'%1$s jara ti yipada lati "%2$s" si "%3$s" taxonomy. Awọn eto ti ni imudojuiwọn.','PublishPress Series Plugin Options have been updated'=>'Awọn aṣayan Plugin PublishPress Series ti ni imudojuiwọn','Permission denied'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ kọ','PublishPress Series Plugin Options have been RESET'=>'Aṣayan Plugin PublishPress Series ti wa ni TUNṣe','Please change these settings carefully as they make significant changes to PublishPress Series.'=>'Jọwọ yipada awọn eto wọnyi pẹlu iṣọra bi wọn ṣe ṣe awọn ayipada pataki si PublishPress Series.','Series Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Series','Delete all PublishPress Series data from the database, on every site in the network, when deleting this plugin. This setting applies network-wide and is only visible to Super Admins.'=>'Pa gbogbo data PublishPress Series kuro ninu ipilẹ data, lori gbogbo aaye ninu nẹtiwọọki, nigbati o ba pa plugin yii. Eto yii kan nẹtiwọọki-gbogbo ati pe o jẹ kedere nikan si awọn Super Admins.','Delete all PublishPress Series data from the database when deleting this plugin.'=>'Pa gbogbo data PublishPress Series kuro ninu ibi ipamọ nigba ti o ba n pa plugin yii.','Series Upgrade'=>'Imudojuiwọn Series','Run Upgrade Task'=>'Ṣiṣejade Iṣẹ Imudojuiwọn','In version 2.11.4, PublishPress Series made changes to how series are stored. You can run the upgrade task here if you\'re having issues with series parts.'=>'Ninu ẹya 2.11.4, PublishPress Series ṣe awọn ayipada si bi a ṣe n pa awọn series. O le ṣiṣẹ iṣẹ imudojuiwọn nibi ti o ba ni awọn iṣoro pẹlu awọn ẹya series.','Sync Series Order to Menu Order'=>'Sopọ Ibere Series si Ibere Menu','Sync to Menu Order'=>'Sopọ si Ibere Menu','This will sync all series part numbers to WordPress menu_order field. Useful for themes/page builders that can only sort by menu order (Page Attributes: Order). This allows you to use native WordPress ordering instead of custom fields.'=>'Eyi yoo sopọ gbogbo awọn nọmba ẹya series si aaye menu_order ti WordPress. Wulo fun awọn akori/olugbasilẹ oju-iwe ti o le ṣe irọrun nikan nipasẹ ibere menu (Awọn Attribut Oju: Ibere). Eyi gba ọ laaye lati lo ibere WordPress abinibi dipo awọn aaye aṣa.','Reset settings'=>'Tun awọn eto','Reset options to default'=>'Tun awọn aṣayan si aiyipada','Layouts'=>'Awọn Layouts','Configure the layout displays shown on posts in a series.'=>'Ṣe iṣeto awọn ifihan apẹrẹ ti a fihan lori awọn ifiweranṣẹ ninu jara kan.','Legacy'=>'Itan','Legacy Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Itan','Default'=>'Aiyipada','CSS Styles'=>'Awọn Ara CSS','Use PublishPress Series CSS styles?'=>'Lo awọn ara CSS PublishPress Series?','Style options'=>'Awọn aṣayan ara','Use default style'=>'Lo ara aiyipada','Use box style'=>'Lo ara apoti','Use dark style'=>'Lo aṣa dudu','Use light style'=>'Lo aṣa imọlẹ','Series Overview'=>'Akopọ Ẹ̀ka','Choose the design for the taxonomy page where a single Series is displayed.'=>'Yan apẹrẹ fun oju-iwe taxonomy ti a fi ẹ̀ka kan han.','Layout:'=>'Ilana:','Choosing a layout different to "Default" will override the taxonomy template from your theme. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the documentation for customizing these designs</a>.'=>'Yiyan apẹrẹ ti o yatọ si "Aiyipada" yoo kọja apẹrẹ taxonomy lati akori rẹ. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ka iwe aṣẹ fun aṣa awọn apẹrẹ wọnyi</a>.','Columns:'=>'Awọn ọwọn:','Order series by:'=>'Paṣẹ ẹ̀ka nipasẹ:','Series part'=>'Apá ẹ̀ka','Order by date'=>'Paṣẹ nipasẹ ọjọ','Series order method'=>'Ọna paṣẹ ẹ̀ka','Series Table of Contents'=>'Atokọ Akọkọ Ẹ̀ka','Series Table of Contents URL:'=>'URL Atokọ Akọkọ Ẹ̀ka:','Series Table of Contents URL'=>'URL Akọkọ Akọsilẹ Series','view page'=>'wo oju-iwe','You must %1$s update your permalink structure %2$s to something other than "Plain" for the Series Table of Contents URL to work.'=>'O gbọdọ %1$s mu iṣeto permalink rẹ %2$s si nkan miiran ju "Plain" lọ ki URL Table of Contents Series le ṣiṣẹ.','Series Per Page:'=>'Ẹ̀ka Fun Oju-iwe:','Series Per Page'=>'Series Per Page','Series Table of Contents Title:'=>'Ak标题 Atokọ Akọkọ Ẹ̀ka:','Series Featured Images'=>'Aworan Ti A Ṣe Afihan Jara','Width for featured image on series table of contents page (in pixels)'=>'Iwọn fun aworan ti a ṣe afihan lori oju-iwe akojọ jara (ní píksẹlì).','Width for featured image on series table of contents page'=>'Iwọn fun aworan ti a ṣe afihan lori oju-iwe akọsilẹ akoonu series','Width for featured image on a post page (in pixels).'=>'Iwọn fun aworan ti a ṣe afihan lori oju-iwe ifiweranṣẹ (ní píksẹlì).','Width for featured image on a post page'=>'Iwọn fun aworan pataki lori oju-iwe ifiweranṣẹ','Width for featured image if displayed via the latest series template (in pixels).'=>'Iwọn fun aworan ti a ṣe afihan ti a ba ṣafihan nipasẹ awoṣe jara tuntun julọ (ní píksẹlì).','Width for featured image if displayed via the latest series template'=>'Iwọn fun aworan pataki ti a ba ṣe afihan nipasẹ awoṣe jara tuntun','Latest Series'=>'Jara Tuntun','This display is used by the "Latest Series" widget.'=>'Iṣafihan yii ni a lo nipasẹ "Jara Tuntun" widget.','Latest Series (tags before):'=>'Jara Tuntun (awọn aami ṣaaju):','Latest Series tags before'=>'Jara Tuntun awọn afi ṣaaju','Latest Series (inner tags):'=>'Jara Tuntun (awọn aami inu):','Latest Series inner tags'=>'Jara Tuntun awọn afi inu','Latest Series (tags after):'=>'Jara Tuntun (awọn aami lẹhin):','Latest Series tags after'=>'Jara Tuntun awọn afi lẹhin','This display is used by the "Series Table of Contents" widget, shortcode, and URL.'=>'Iṣafihan yii ni a lo nipasẹ "Tabili Akopọ Jara" widget, shortcode, ati URL.','This display is used by the "Series Table of Contents". To find the URL for this display, go the "Display" tab and then "Series Table of Contents URL".'=>'Iṣafihan yii ni a lo nipasẹ "Tabili Akopọ Jara". Lati wa URL fun iṣafihan yii, lọ si taabu "Iṣafihan" ki o si "Tabili Akopọ Jara URL".','These settings allow you to customize the metabox on the post editing screen.'=>'Awọn eto wọnyi gba ọ laaye lati ṣe akanṣe metabox lori iboju ṣiṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ.','Default Series Order'=>'Aṣẹ Jara Aiyipada','Alphabetical A-Z'=>'A-Z nipasẹ Alifabeeti','Alphabetical Z-A'=>'Z-A nipasẹ Alifabeeti','Show "Add New"'=>'Fihan "Fikun-un Tuntun"','Show Add New'=>'Fihan Fi Tuntun Kun','Show "Post title in widget"'=>'Fihan "Orukọ ifiweranṣẹ ninu widget"','Show Post title in widget'=>'Fihan Akọle ifiweranṣẹ ninu widget','Metabox Series Order'=>'Aṣẹ Metabox Jara','Post Details Settings'=>'Eto Awọn alaye Ifiweranṣẹ','Configure the Series Post Details display shown on posts in a series.'=>'Ṣeto iṣafihan Awọn alaye Ifiweranṣẹ Jara ti a fihan lori awọn ifiweranṣẹ ninu jara kan.','As in Template'=>'Gẹgẹbi ninu Awoṣe','Display Series Post Details?'=>'Ṣiṣafihan Awọn alaye Ifiweranṣẹ Jara?','Post Details Selection'=>'Yiyan Awọn alaye Ifiweranṣẹ','Edit this layout'=>'Ṣatunkọ àtẹ̀jáde yìí','Loading…'=>'Nṣiṣẹ…','Post Details Position'=>'Ipò Àlàyé Fífi','Series Meta Template'=>'Àtẹ̀jáde Meta Ẹ̀kó','Series Meta (with excerpts)'=>'Meta Ẹ̀kó (pẹlu àpẹẹrẹ)','Show Series Post Details only on single post screens, not archives or blog listings.'=>'Fihan Alaye Ifiweranṣẹ Jara nikan lori awọn iboju ifiweranṣẹ kan, kii ṣe awọn akọsilẹ tabi atokọ bulọọgi.','Post List Box Settings'=>'Àwọn Àtọ́kà Post List Box','Configure the Post List Box that displays all posts in a series.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe àtọ́kà Post List Box tí ń fi gbogbo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ hàn nínú ẹ̀kó kan.','Display Post List Boxes?'=>'Ṣe àfihàn Àtọ́kà Post List Boxes?','Post List Boxes Selection'=>'Yiyan Àtọ́kà Post List Boxes','Edit this box'=>'Ṣatunkọ àpoti yìí','Post List Box Position'=>'Ipò Àtọ́kà Post List Box','Post List Box Template'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ Apoti Àtẹ̀jáde','Post Title (Linked Post)'=>'Àkọlé Post (Post Tí a So)','Post Title Linked Post'=>'Akọle Ifiweranṣẹ Tẹmọ Ifiweranṣẹ','Post Title (Current Post)'=>'Àkọlé Post (Post Tí o Wà Lọwọ́lọwọ)','Post Title Current Post'=>'Akọle Ifiweranṣẹ Ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ','Navigation Settings'=>'Àtọ́kà Iṣàkóso','Configure the Series Navigation display shown on posts in a series.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe àfihàn Iṣàkóso Ẹ̀kó tí a fi hàn lórí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ nínú ẹ̀kó kan.','Display Series Navigation?'=>'Ṣe àfihàn Iṣàkóso Ẹ̀kó?','Navigation Selection'=>'Yiyan Irin-ajo','Navigation Position'=>'Ipo Irin-ajo','Navigation Template'=>'Awoṣe Irin-ajo','Next Post Text'=>'Ọrọ Iposti Tó Ń Bọ','Previous Post Text'=>'Ọrọ Iposti Tó Ṣáájú','First Post Text'=>'Ọrọ Iposti Àkọ́kọ́','Post Types'=>'Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','Custom Post Type Support'=>'Support Irú Akọsilẹ̀ Àdáni','Enable PublishPress Series for custom post types.'=>'Mú Ẹ̀rọ PublishPress Series ṣiṣẹ́ fún irú akọsilẹ̀ àdáni.','Pro Features'=>'Àwọn ẹya Pro','These settings allow you enable or disable features in PublishPress Series Pro.'=>'Àwọn eto wọ̀nyí jẹ́ kí o ní ànfààní tàbí kó pa àwọn ẹya mọ́ nínú PublishPress Series Pro.','Series Category'=>'Ẹ̀ka Series','Settings for Series Categories archive URL and display behavior.'=>'Àwọn eto fún URL ìkànsí Ẹ̀ka Series àti ihuwasi àfihàn.','Series Categories URL Base:'=>'Ibi URL Ẹ̀ka Series:','This text will be used in Series Categories archive URLs. If you change it, old URLs will be redirected to the new base.'=>'Ọrọ yìí máa ṣee lo nínú URL ìkànsí Ẹ̀ka Series. Tí o bá yí i padà, awọn URL atijọ́ máa ṣe àtúnṣe sí ibi tuntun.','Series Categories Archive Template:'=>'Awoṣe Ibi ipamọ Ẹka jara:','Use template from Theme'=>'Lo awoṣe lati Theme','Use template from Plugin'=>'Lo awoṣe lati Plugin','Theme template uses your active theme template hierarchy. Plugin template uses PublishPress Series fallback design when your theme does not provide taxonomy-series_group.php.'=>'Awoṣe theme nlo ilana awoṣe theme ti o wa lọwọlọwọ. Awoṣe plugin nlo apẹrẹ isalẹ PublishPress Series nigbati theme rẹ ko pese taxonomy-series_group.php.','Plugin Template Display Options:'=>'Awọn aṣayan Ifihan Awoṣe Plugin:','Show Series Featured Image'=>'Fi Aworan Ti A Ṣe Afihan Jara Han','Show Series Description'=>'Fihan Apejuwe Jara','Show Posts in each Series as list items'=>'Fihan Awọn ifiweranṣẹ ni gbogbo Jara gẹgẹ bi awọn nkan akojọ','This feature allows you to create a new taxonomy for this plugin to use if you don\'t want to use the default "Series" taxonomy.'=>'Iwa yii n jẹ ki o ṣẹda taxonomy tuntun fun plugin yii lati lo ti o ko ba fẹ lo taxonomy "Jara" aiyipada.','Series Taxonomy Slug:'=>'Slug Taxonomy Jara:','Series Taxonomy Slug'=>'Jara Taxonomy Slug','This text will be part of the series base URL.'=>'Ọrọ yii yoo jẹ apakan ti URL ipilẹ jara.','Series Taxonomy:'=>'Taxonomy Jara:','To create a new taxonomy, enter the new name and click the "Update Options" button.'=>'Lati ṣẹda taxonomy tuntun, tẹ orukọ tuntun ki o si tẹ bọtini "Imudojuiwọn Awọn aṣayan".','Migrate Terms'=>'Gbe Awọn ọrọ','Automatically migrate existing series terms to the new taxonomy'=>'Gbe awọn ọrọ jara to wa tẹlẹ laifọwọyi si taxonomy tuntun','If checked, all terms from the current taxonomy will be migrated to the new taxonomy when you change the taxonomy slug. If unchecked, only the taxonomy slug will be changed.'=>'Ti o ba ti ṣayẹwo, gbogbo awọn ọrọ lati taxonomy ti o wa lọwọlọwọ yoo gbe si taxonomy tuntun nigbati o ba yi slug taxonomy pada. Ti o ko ba ṣayẹwo, slug taxonomy nikan ni yoo yipada.','Sorry, no results found.'=>'E ma binu, ko si awọn esi ti a ri.','Series navigation'=>'Iṣàkóso Series','Allow custom post types to be used with PublishPress Series.'=>'Gba irú akọsilẹ̀ àdáni láti lo pẹ̀lú PublishPress Series.','Shortcodes'=>'Koodu Kékèké','Provides shortcodes to display series information.'=>'N pese koodu kékèké láti fi hàn ìmọ̀ràn series.','Extra Tokens'=>'Àwọn Ọ̀rọ̀ Tó Kù','Provides extra tokens to customize the output of series information.'=>'N pese àwọn ọrọ̀ tó kù láti ṣe àtúnṣe àbájáde ìmọ̀ràn series.','Multiple Series'=>'Ọpọ̀ Series','Allows authors to add posts to more than one series.'=>'Gba àwọn onkọ̀wé láti fi àwọn ìposti kún diẹ ẹ̀dá ẹgbẹ̀run kan.','Welcome panel dismissed.'=>'Panele ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ti parí.','Dismiss this panel'=>'Fagilee panẹli yii','Welcome to PublishPress Series'=>'Kaabo si PublishPress Jara','A series groups your posts together and shows your readers the reading order. Create your first series with the form on this page, then add posts to it.'=>'Jara kan n ṣopọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ pọ ati fi aṣẹ kika han awọn oluka rẹ. Ṣẹda jara rẹ akọkọ pẹlu fọọmu lori oju-iwe yii, lẹhinna fi awọn ifiweranṣẹ kun un.','Create a series'=>'Ṣẹda jara kan','View Documentation'=>'Wo Iwe Itọsọna','Upgrade to Pro'=>'Gbadun si Pro','PublishPress Series'=>'PublishPress Series','Display a styled list of posts from a Series.'=>'Fihan atokọ ti a ṣe aṣa ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ lati inu Jara kan.','Display the current post details from a Series.'=>'Fihan awọn alaye ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ lati inu Jara kan.','Display navigation links for posts in a Series.'=>'Fihan awọn ọna asopọ isọdọkan fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ ninu Jara kan.','Series List'=>'Atokọ Jara','Display a customizable list of Series or Series Categories.'=>'Fihan atokọ ti a le ṣe akanṣe ti Awọn Series tabi Awọn Ẹka Series.','%s series'=>'%s jara' . "\0" . '','%s post'=>'%s ifiweranṣẹ' . "\0" . '','Editorial Series'=>'Ẹ̀ka Àtẹ́jade','A sample Series Category description.'=>'Àpejúwe Ẹ̀ka Àdájọ́.','Magazine Issues'=>'Ìṣàkóso Ìwé ìròyìn','Tutorial Collections'=>'Ìkọ̀kó Kọ́mputa','Alpha Series'=>'Ẹ̀ka Alfa','A sample description for this Series.'=>'Àpejúwe àpẹẹrẹ fún Ẹ̀ka yìí.','Bravo Series'=>'Ẹ̀ka Bravo','Charlie Series'=>'Ẹ̀ka Charlie','Default layout'=>'Àtẹ́lẹwọ́ aiyé','Current series'=>'Ẹ̀ka lọwọlọwọ','Actions provided by PublishPress plugins.'=>'Àwọn iṣe tí PublishPress plugins pese.','Discover Series features and identifiers'=>'Ṣawari awọn ẹya ara Series ati awọn idanimọ','Discover the native series taxonomy, Series Categories, supported post types, publishing and active Pro addons. Layout discovery uses get-layout; settings use get-plugin-settings. Hub supplies generic post lookup.'=>'Ṣawari taxonomy ẹsẹ abinibi, Ẹka Series, awọn oriṣi ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe atilẹyin, tẹjade ati awọn afikun Pro ti n ṣiṣẹ. Iwadii apẹrẹ nlo get-layout; awọn eto nlo get-plugin-settings. Hub n pese wiwa ifiweranṣẹ gbogbogbo.','Find Series and Series Categories'=>'Wa Series ati Ẹka Series','Find native Series terms or Series Categories by name. Returns native term metadata and concurrency tokens without exposing post content.'=>'Wa awọn ọrọ Series abinibi tabi Ẹka Series nipasẹ orukọ. N pada metadata ọrọ abinibi ati awọn ami idapọ lai fi akoonu ifiweranṣẹ han.','Read posts in a Series'=>'Ka awọn ifiweranṣẹ ninu Ẹsẹ','List readable posts with their native part numbers, pending order, status and date. Pagination filters unreadable objects first. Get-post-series supplies edit tokens for individual posts.'=>'Atokọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a le ka pẹlu awọn nọmba apakan abinibi wọn, aṣẹ to n bọ, ipo ati ọjọ. Àlẹmọ pagination n ṣàlẹmọ awọn ohun ti a ko le ka akọkọ. Get-post-series n pese awọn ami ṣiṣatunkọ fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ kọọkan.','Inspect a Series or category'=>'Ṣayẹwo Ẹsẹ tabi ẹka','Read name, description, icon, order, category assignments and expected_hash. Series Categories use taxonomy=category. Parent IDs apply to hierarchical categories.'=>'Ka ọmọ ẹgbẹ Series, awọn nọmba apakan, akọle kukuru widget ati awọn ohun-ini bulọọki Gutenberg Series fun ifiweranṣẹ ti a le ka ti a ṣe atilẹyin. N pada expected_hash ti n bo aṣẹ Series ti o ni ipa ati akoonu.','Create or update a Series or category'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn Ẹsẹ tabi ẹka','Create with name, or patch an existing id and expected_hash. Omitted fields remain unchanged. icon_id is a readable image attachment; zero clears the Series icon. category_ids replace Series category assignments; [] clears them. dry_run previews.'=>'Ṣẹda pẹlu orukọ, tabi patch ID ti o wa tẹlẹ ati expected_hash. Awọn aaye ti a yọkuro ko yipada. icon_id jẹ aworan ti a le ka; odo nu aami Series. category_ids rọpo awọn atokọ ẹka Series; [] nu wọn. dry_run n ṣe iwadii.','Delete a Series or category'=>'Pa Ẹsẹ tabi ẹka run','Delete a native taxonomy term without deleting its posts. Requires the current term and membership token and permission to edit all affected posts. dry_run previews. Large collections remain in native administration.'=>'Pa ọrọ taxonomy abinibi run lai pa awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ run. Nbeere ọrọ lọwọlọwọ ati ami iṣọpọ ati aṣẹ lati ṣe atunṣe gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ipa. dry_run n ṣe iwadii. Awọn ikojọpọ nla wa ninu iṣakoso abinibi.','Inspect a post’s Series and block assignments'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn atokọ Series ati bulọọki ifiweranṣẹ','Read Series membership, part numbers, widget short title and Series Gutenberg block attributes for a readable editable supported post. Returns expected_hash covering affected Series order and content.'=>'Ka ọmọ ẹgbẹ Series, awọn nọmba apakan, akọle kukuru widget ati awọn ohun-ini bulọọki Gutenberg Series fun ifiweranṣẹ ti a le ka ti a ṣe atilẹyin. N pada expected_hash ti n bo aṣẹ Series ti o ni ipa ati akoonu.','Set post Series, part numbers and widget title'=>'Ṣeto Series ifiweranṣẹ, awọn nọmba apakan ati akọle widget','Replace memberships with items; [] removes all. Omit items to update only short_title. Part zero uses native automatic placement. Multiple Series requires active Pro Multiple Series. All posts whose numbering can change require native read/edit permission. Read expected_hash from get-series before adding a new membership. dry_run previews.'=>'Rọpo awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ pẹlu awọn ohun; [] yọ gbogbo wọn. Yọ awọn ohun lati ṣe imudojuiwọn nikan short_title. Apakan odo n lo ipamọ aifọwọyi abinibi. Awọn Series pupọ n beere Pro Multiple Series ti n ṣiṣẹ. Gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti numbering wọn le yipada n beere aṣẹ kika/ṣe atunṣe abinibi. Ka expected_hash lati get-series ṣaaju ki o to fi ọmọ ẹgbẹ tuntun kun. dry_run n ṣe iwadii.','Update Series memberships for multiple posts'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ Series fun ọpọlọpọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ','Validate every explicit post, Series token and native permission before updating up to 20 posts. Each row uses the same input as update-post-series. Omitted fields are preserved. dry_run previews all rows. Native numbering is not transactional; inspect complete, applied_ids and failed_id before retrying a partial result.'=>'Ṣayẹwo gbogbo ifiweranṣẹ ti o han, ami Series ati awọn igbanilaaye abinibi ṣaaju ki o to ṣe imudojuiwọn si 20 ifiweranṣẹ. Gbogbo awọn ila nlo awọn alaye kanna bi imudojuiwọn-ifiranṣẹ-series. Awọn aaye ti a yọkuro ni a pa. dry_run n ṣafihan gbogbo awọn ila. Iṣiro abinibi ko jẹ iṣowo; ṣayẹwo kikun, applied_ids ati failed_id ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju abajade apakan.','Order, publish, schedule or unpublish Series posts'=>'Pipin, tẹjade, eto tabi yọ ifiweranṣẹ Series kuro ni atẹjade','Native Series Order and Publish Series workflows. Get expected_hash from get-series. order requires the complete counted post set and never publishes drafts. pending-order requires complete unpublished set. publish accepts selected pending/draft posts; date is optional site-local YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM for scheduling. unpublish affects the entire Series. trash requires explicit post_ids and native deletion capabilities. mark-published changes only the Series marker. date-asc/date-desc reuse native publication-date ordering. Cross-Series status transitions require series_tokens from get-series for the other memberships. sync-menu-order copies part numbers to WordPress menu order. All affected objects are preflighted; native multi-step operations are not transactional. dry_run previews.'=>'Iṣiro Abinibi Series ati Tẹjade awọn iṣẹ ọna Series. Gba expected_hash lati get-series. aṣẹ nilo gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ka ni kikun ati pe ko tẹjade awọn iwe afọwọkọ. pending-order nilo set ti a ko tẹjade ni kikun. tẹjade gba awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan ti o wa ni idaduro/ifuye; ọjọ jẹ aṣayan aaye-lokal YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM fun eto. yọkuro ni ipa lori gbogbo Series. egbin nilo awọn id_ifiranṣẹ ti o han ati awọn agbara iparun abinibi. mark-published yipada nikan ami Series. ọjọ-asc/ ọjọ-desc tun lo aṣẹ ọjọ-tẹjade abinibi. Awọn iyipada ipo Cross-Series nilo series_tokens lati get-series fun awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ miiran. sync-menu-order da awọn nọmba apakan silẹ si aṣẹ akojọ WordPress. Gbogbo awọn ohun ti o ni ipa ni a ṣayẹwo; awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ọwọ-multi abinibi ko jẹ iṣowo. dry_run n ṣafihan.','Add or configure a Series Gutenberg block'=>'Fi kun tabi tunto bọọlu Series Gutenberg','Append a native Series block or update one using its zero-based path from get-post-series. Only registered Series block attributes are accepted, with native editor availability and layout access checks. No arbitrary HTML or other block edits. dry_run previews.'=>'Fi bọọlu Series abinibi kun tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn ọkan nipa lilo ọna rẹ ti o da lori odo lati get-post-series. Awọn ẹya bọọlu Series ti a forukọsilẹ nikan ni a gba, pẹlu iraye si olootu abinibi ati awọn idanwo iraye si atokọ. Ko si HTML ti ko ni ilana tabi awọn atunṣe bọọlu miiran. dry_run n ṣafihan.','This Series term does not exist.'=>'Akọsọ Series yii ko si.','Series membership could not be read.'=>'Ko le ka awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ Series.','Use native administration for more than 1,000 affected records.'=>'Lo iṣakoso abinibi fun diẹ ẹ sii ju 1,000 awọn igbasilẹ ti o ni ipa.','Use native administration for this category hierarchy.'=>'Lo iṣakoso abinibi fun iṣeto ẹka yii.','Use native administration for more than 1,000 affected posts.'=>'Lo iṣakoso abinibi fun diẹ ẹ sii ju 1,000 awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ipa.','Supply a Series or category name.'=>'Pese orukọ Series tabi ẹka kan.','These fields apply only to Series, not Series Categories.'=>'Awọn aaye wọnyi kan si Series nikan, kii ṣe Awọn Ẹka Series.','Use an existing category parent without a cycle.'=>'Lo obi ẹka ti o wa tẹlẹ laisi iyipo.','Unknown Series Category.'=>'Ẹka Series ti ko mọ.','Multiple membership requires the active Pro Multiple Series feature; duplicate Series IDs are invalid.'=>'Iṣeduro pupọ nilo ẹya Pro Multiple Series ti n ṣiṣẹ; awọn ID Series ti o daakọ ko wulo.','Supply one token per Series.'=>'Pese ami kan fun Series kọọkan.','Unknown Series.'=>'Series ti ko mọ.','A target Series no longer exists.'=>'Series ti a fojusi ko si mọ.','Each bulk post target must appear only once.'=>'Ibi-afẹde ifiweranṣẹ kọọkan gbọdọ farahan ni ẹẹkan nikan.','The batch changed. Read every affected object before retrying.'=>'Iwọn ti yipada. Ka gbogbo ohun ti o ni ipa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','A native bulk update could not be fully confirmed. Read affected objects before retrying.'=>'Imudojuiwọn iboṣilẹ abinibi ko le jẹrisi ni kikun. Ka awọn ohun ti o ni ipa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Post content changed during the native batch. Read affected posts before retrying.'=>'Akopọ ifiweranṣẹ yipada lakoko iboṣilẹ abinibi. Ka awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ipa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Every target must belong to this Series.'=>'Gbogbo ibi-afẹde gbọdọ jẹ ti Series yii.','This operation applies to the Series; omit post_ids.'=>'Iṣẹ yii kan si Series; yọkuro post_ids.','Publication dates apply only to publish operations.'=>'Awọn ọjọ atẹjade kan si awọn iṣẹ tẹjade nikan.','Supply explicit post_ids for this operation.'=>'Pese awọn id_ifiranṣẹ ti o han fun iṣẹ yii.','Native menu-order targets could not be read.'=>'Ko le ka awọn ibi-afẹde aṣẹ akojọ abinibi.','Menu-order sync accepts only native published, numbered posts.'=>'Akojọ-aṣẹ sync gba awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade ni abinibi, ti a ka nikan.','Supply the complete native ordered post set; no hidden targets are changed.'=>'Pese set ti o paṣẹ ni kikun ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ abinibi; ko si ibi-afẹde ti a pa mọ ni a yipada.','Use a valid site-local publication date.'=>'Lo ọjọ atẹjade aaye-lokal to wulo.','Read the current Series block path before editing.'=>'Ka ọna bọọlu Series lọwọlọwọ ṣaaju ki o to ṣiṣatunkọ.','Read Series layout fields and settings'=>'Ka awọn aaye ati awọn eto atokọ Series','Inspect a Post List Box, Post Details or Post Navigation layout. Omit id to discover native fields/defaults for a new layout. Includes exact JSON schema, native labels and edition locks. Use list-layouts to find IDs.'=>'Ṣayẹwo Akojọ Ifiweranṣẹ, Awọn alaye Ifiweranṣẹ tabi atokọ Iṣipopada Ifiweranṣẹ. Yọ id lati wa awọn aaye abinibi/defaults fun atokọ tuntun. Ṣafikun apẹrẹ JSON gangan, awọn aami abinibi ati awọn idena editi. Lo atokọ-atokọ lati wa awọn ID.','Find Series layouts'=>'Wa awọn atokọ Series','List readable native Series layouts, including trash when requested.'=>'Akojọ awọn atokọ Series abinibi ti a le ka, pẹlu egbin ti a beere.','Create or update a Series layout'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn atokọ Series','Create a published layout or patch one by id and expected_hash. Use get-layout for exact per-module field types and locks. JSON booleans for checkboxes, integers for sizes and image IDs, strings for select choices. Omitted fields and unrelated metadata remain unchanged. dry_run previews.'=>'Ṣẹda atokọ ti a tẹjade tabi ṣe atunṣe ọkan nipasẹ id ati expected_hash. Lo get-layout fun awọn iru aaye ti o wa ni pato fun modulu kọọkan ati awọn idena. JSON booleans fun awọn apoti ayẹwo, integers fun awọn iwọn ati awọn ID aworan, awọn okun fun awọn yiyan yiyan. Awọn aaye ti a yọkuro ati awọn metadata ti ko ni ibatan wa ni a ko yipada. dry_run n ṣafihan.','Trash, restore or delete a Series layout'=>'Egbin, tun pada tabi pa atokọ Series kan','Native layout lifecycle. Read id and expected_hash first. Permanent deletion requires prior trash and native delete permission. dry_run previews.'=>'Igbesi aye atokọ abinibi. Ka id ati expected_hash akọkọ. Iparun to wa ni pẹlẹpẹlẹ nilo egbin ti tẹlẹ ati igbanilaaye iparun abinibi. dry_run n ṣafihan.','Use native administration for more than 1,000 layouts.'=>'Lo iṣakoso abinibi fun diẹ ẹ sii ju 1,000 awọn awoṣe.','Supply a title for the new layout.'=>'Pese akọle fun awoṣe tuntun.','Restore the layout before editing.'=>'Tọju awoṣe naa ṣaaju ṣiṣatunkọ.','This layout field requires an active Pro feature.'=>'Ibi awoṣe yii nilo ẹya Pro ti n ṣiṣẹ.','The layout exists but its settings were not fully confirmed. Read before retrying.'=>'Awoṣe naa wa ṣugbọn awọn eto rẹ ko tii jẹrisi ni kikun. Ka ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','This lifecycle operation does not match the current layout state.'=>'Iṣe igbesi aye yii ko ba ipo awoṣe lọwọlọwọ mu.','Use the exact fields, types and choices returned by discovery.'=>'Lo awọn aaye, awọn iru, ati awọn yiyan gangan ti a da pada nipasẹ iwadii.','You do not have permission to use this Series operation.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati lo iṣẹ Iseries yii.','Invalid JSON type at %s.'=>'Iru JSON ti ko tọ ni %s.','Series could not complete this operation. Inspect the current state before retrying; some changes may have been saved.'=>'Iseries ko le pari iṣẹ yii. Ṣayẹwo ipo lọwọlọwọ ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju; diẹ ninu awọn ayipada le ti wa ni fipamọ.','This object changed. Read it again before saving.'=>'Ohun yii ti yipada. Ka a lẹẹkansi ṣaaju fipamọ.','The operation could not be fully confirmed. Read the object before retrying; some changes may have been saved.'=>'Iṣe naa ko le jẹrisi ni kikun. Ka ohun naa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju; diẹ ninu awọn ayipada le ti wa ni fipamọ.','Read Series settings and choices'=>'Ka awọn eto Iseries ati awọn yiyan','Discover native Series Settings: automatic displays, layouts, legacy templates, category archives, metabox, sorting, uninstall policy and active Pro features. Booleans use JSON true/false; layout IDs are integers. No license or account credentials are returned.'=>'Ṣawari Awọn Eto Iseries abinibi: awọn ifihan laifọwọyi, awọn awoṣe, awọn apẹrẹ atijọ, awọn iwe ipamọ ẹka, metabox, iṣiro, eto yiyọkuro ati awọn ẹya Pro ti n ṣiṣẹ. Boolean nlo JSON otitọ/irọ; awọn ID awoṣe jẹ awọn integer. Ko si iwe-aṣẹ tabi awọn alaye akọọlẹ ti a da pada.','Update Series settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto Iseries','Patch the exact keys discovered by get-plugin-settings. Preserve omitted settings. Read expected_hash first. dry_run previews without saving. Pro addon and post-type changes take effect on the next request. Taxonomy identity migrations remain in native administration.'=>'Patch awọn bọtini gangan ti a ṣe awari nipasẹ get-plugin-settings. Pa awọn eto ti a yọkuro mọ. Ka expected_hash akọkọ. dry_run n ṣafihan laisi fipamọ. Awọn ayipada afikun Pro ati iru ifiweranṣẹ ni ipa lori ibeere atẹle. Awọn gbigbe idanimọ taxonomy duro ni iṣakoso abinibi.','Display Series Post List Boxes?'=>'Ṣafihan Awọn apoti Àkọsílẹ Iseries?','This text requires unfiltered_html. Use safe post HTML.'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ yii nilo unfiltered_html. Lo HTML ifiweranṣẹ to ni aabo.','You\'re using PublishPress Series Free. The Pro version has more features and support. %1$sUpgrade to Pro%2$s'=>'O n lo PublishPress Series Free. Ẹya Pro ni awọn ẹya diẹ sii ati atilẹyin. %1$sṢe imudojuiwọn si Pro%2$s','Need PublishPress Series Support?'=>'Nilo Atilẹyin PublishPress Series?','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Ti o ba nilo iranlọwọ tabi ni ibeere ẹya tuntun, jọwọ jẹ ki a mọ.','Request Support'=>'Beere Atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ alaye tun wa lori oju opo wẹẹbu amugbooro naa.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo Ipilẹ Ọgbọ́n','An error occured'=>'Aṣiṣe kan ṣẹlẹ','%1$s series migrated to new taxonomy'=>'%1$s jara ti a gbe lọ si imọ-ẹrọ tuntun','No series found.'=>'Ko si Iseries ti a ri.','1 series found.'=>'1 Iseries ni a ri.','%d series found.'=>'%d Iseries ni a ri.','Enter a name for the new series.'=>'Tẹ orukọ kan fun Iseries tuntun.','Custom Template'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ aṣa','Layout options loaded.'=>'Awọn aṣayan awoṣe ti wa ni gbigba.','Layout options could not be loaded. Reload the page to try again.'=>'Ko le gba awọn aṣayan awoṣe. Tun awọn oju-iwe naa ṣe lati gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','If you like %1$s, please leave us a %2$s rating. Thank you!'=>'Tí o bá fẹ́ %1$s, jọ̀wọ́ fi àyẹ̀wò %2$s sílẹ̀ fún wa. Ẹ ṣéun!','five-star'=>'marun-star','About PublishPress Series'=>'Nipa PublishPress Jara','About'=>'Nipa','PublishPress Series Documentation'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ PublishPress Jara','Documentation'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ','Contact the PublishPress team'=>'Kan si ẹgbẹ PublishPress','Contact'=>'Kan si','Follow PublishPress on Twitter'=>'Tẹle PublishPress lori Twitter','Follow PublishPress on Facebook'=>'Tẹle PublishPress lori Facebook','Select Media'=>'Yan Media','Selected Image:'=>'Aworan ti a yan:','Sorry but you don\'t have permission to add series'=>'E ma binu ṣugbọn o ko ni igbanilaaye lati fi jara kun','Sorry but security check failed'=>'Ma binu ṣugbọn ayewo aabo kuna','The name you picked isn\'t sanitizing correctly. Try something different.'=>'Orukọ ti o yan ko ni imukuro ni deede. Gbiyanju nkan miiran.','Hmm... it looks like there is already a series with that name. Try something else'=>'Hmm... o dabi pe jara kan ti wa pẹlu orukọ yẹn. Gbiyanju nkan miiran','Series added.'=>'Jara ti ṣafikun.','Not part of a series'=>'Kii ṣe apakan jara','New series name'=>'Orúkọ ẹ̀ka tuntun','Search series'=>'Wa jara','Series Part:'=>'Apakan Jara:','Series Part'=>'Apá Jara','Post title in widget:'=>'Akole ifiweranṣẹ ninu widget:','A short title of this post that will be used in the Series widget. Leave blank to use the full title.'=>'Akọle kukuru ti ifiweranṣẹ yii ti a yoo lo ninu widget Series. Fi silẹ silẹ lati lo akọle pipe.','Post title in widget'=>'Akọle ifiweranṣẹ ninu widget','<a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">%3$s</a> (No part number)'=>'<a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">%3$s</a> (Ko si nọmba apakan)','<a href="%3$s" title="%4$s">%5$s</a> (Part %1$s of %2$s)'=>'<a href="%3$s" title="%4$s">%5$s</a> (Apakan %1$s ti %2$s)','<a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">%3$s</a>  (No Part Number)'=>'<a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">%3$s</a>  (Ko si Nọmba Apakan)','No Series'=>'Ko si Series','View all series'=>'Wo gbogbo awọn jara','Filter by series'=>'Fọkansi nipasẹ Iseries','Manage All Series'=>'Ṣakoso Gbogbo Awọn Jara','PublishPress Series could not save the series featured image. The featured image was not changed.'=>'PublishPress Jara kò le fipamọ aworan ti a ṣe afihan jara. Aworan ti a ṣe afihan ko yipada.','Database error: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe database: %s','Order saved.'=>'Pipin ti fipamọ.','The new order could not be saved. Reload the page and try again.'=>'A ko le fipamọ pipa tuntun. Tun awọn oju-iwe naa ṣe ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Term Order'=>'Ilana Ọrọ','To reposition an item, drag and drop the row by "clicking and holding" it anywhere and moving it to its new position.'=>'Lati tun ipo nkan kan, fa ati tu ila pẹlu "titẹ ati mimu" rẹ ni ibikibi ki o si gbe e si ipo titun rẹ.','You can also use the "Move up" and "Move down" buttons in each row. They work with the keyboard and save the new order straight away.'=>'O tun le lo bọtini "Gbe soke" ati "Gbe soke" ni ọkọọkan. Wọn ṣiṣẹ pẹlu bọtini itẹwe ati fipamọ pipa tuntun lẹsẹkẹsẹ.','Series deleted.'=>'Jara ti paarẹ.','Series updated.'=>'Jara ti ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Series not added.'=>'Jara ko ti ṣafikun.','Series not updated.'=>'Jara ko ti ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Posts'=>'Awọn ifiweranṣẹ','ID'=>'ID','Terms are usually ordered alphabetically, but you can choose your own order by entering a number (1 for first, etc.) in this field.'=>'Awọn ọrọ nigbagbogbo ni a paṣẹ ni lẹta, ṣugbọn o le yan ilana tirẹ nipa titẹ nọmba kan (1 fun akọkọ, bbl) ni aaye yii.','Current series featured image:'=>'Aworan ti a ṣe afihan jara lọwọlọwọ:','No featured image currently'=>'Ko si aworan ti a ṣe afihan lọwọlọwọ','Delete image? (note: there will not be an image associated with this series if you select this)'=>'Pa aworan? (akọsilẹ: ko si aworan ti o ni nkan ṣe pẹlu jara yii ti o ba yan eyi)','Series featured image upload:'=>'Ikọsẹ aworan ti a ṣe afihan jara:','Upload a featured image for the series.'=>'Gbe aworan pataki kalẹ fun jara naa.','Invalid form data'=>'Data fọọmu ti ko tọ','Invalid nonce, reload and try again'=>'Nonce ti ko tọ, tun gbe e ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi','Invalid taxonomy'=>'Taxonomy ti ko tọ','Not enough permission'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ ti ko to','Updated successfully'=>'Ti a ṣe imudojuiwọn ni aṣeyọri','Series order metadata could not be read. No cleanup was authorized.'=>'A ko le ka metadata pipa Iseries. Ko si mimọ ti a fọwọsi.','Settings'=>'Àwọn àṣàyàn','PublishPress Series Options'=>'Àwọn aṣayan PublishPress Series','Are you sure you want to Reset?'=>'Ṣe o dajudaju pe o fẹ lati tunṣe?','Taxonomy'=>'Taxonomy','Metabox'=>'Metabox','Advanced'=>'Ijinle','Select "Not part of a series" to remove any series data from post'=>'Yan "Kò jẹ́ apá ti jara" lati yọ eyikeyi data jara kuro ninu ifiweranṣẹ','&larr; Go to Series'=>'&larr; Lọ si Jara','View Series'=>'Wo Jara','Series Link'=>'Lọ́ńkò Jara','A link to a Series'=>'Akọ́kọ́ sí Jara kan','Series Navigation'=>'Iṣàkóso Jara','Series: '=>'Jara: ','Posts from the series: '=>'Àwọn ifiweranṣẹ lati jara: ','Series:'=>'Jara:','Part:'=>'Apá:','&mdash; No Change &mdash;'=>'&mdash; Ko si Ayipada &mdash;','All the Series I\'ve Written'=>'Gbogbo Jara tí mo ti kọ','<a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">Series</a>'=>'<a href="%1$s" title="%2$s">Ẹ̀ka</a>','Series featured image'=>'Aworan pataki jara','View series: %s'=>'Wo jara: %s','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ṣii ni taabu tuntun)','Available in PublishPress Series Pro'=>'Wa ni PublishPress Iseries Pro','Auto/None'=>'Auto/Ko si','Use this to control the output of the latest series widget'=>'Lo eyi lati ṣakoso iṣẹjade ti widget jara tuntun julọ','Most Recent Series'=>'Jara Tuntun Jùlọ','Title:'=>'Ak title:','The layout and content of this widget can be adjusted via the <a href="%s">Latest Series</a> area.'=>'Iṣeto ati akoonu ti widget yii le ṣe atunṣe nipasẹ agbegbe <a href="%s">Jara Tuntun</a>.','Hide series with no posts?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ pa awọn jara ti ko ni awọn ifiweranṣẹ?','Order by:'=>'Paṣẹ nipasẹ:','Number of posts in Series'=>'Iye awọn ifiweranṣẹ ninu Jara','Name of Series'=>'Orukọ Jara','Series Slug'=>'Slug Jara','When Series was Created'=>'Nigbati Jara ti ṣẹda','Random'=>'Ayanfẹ','Number of series to display:'=>'Iye awọn jara lati ṣe afihan:','Display Order: '=>'Paṣẹ Ifihan: ','ASC: '=>'ASC: ','DESC: '=>'DESC: ','Use this to display the Series Table of contents'=>'Lo eyi lati ṣe afihan Tabili akoonu Jara','Select Series'=>'Yan Jara','Other posts in series:'=>'Awọn ifiweranṣẹ miiran ninu jara:','Show Series Table Of Content'=>'Fihan Tabili Akopọ Ẹ̀ka','Show Series Table Of Content as:'=>'Fihan Tabili Akopọ Ẹ̀ka gẹ́gẹ́ bi:','Dropdown:'=>'Iṣọkan:','List:'=>'Àtòjọ:','Show post count:'=>'Fihan iye ifiweranṣẹ:','Hide empty series:'=>'Pa ẹ̀ka tí kò ní akoonu sílẹ̀:','name'=>'orúkọ','count'=>'iye','slug'=>'slug','series id'=>'id ẹ̀ka','Order:'=>'Àṣẹ:','Exclude series:'=>'Yọ ẹ̀ka kúrò:','Include series:'=>'Fọwọ́sowọpọ̀ ẹ̀ka:','Number of Series:'=>'Iye Ẹ̀ka:','Offset:'=>'Ipo:','You can select the offset for the number of series (useful for paging).  No offset if left blank'=>'O le yan ipo fun iye ẹ̀ka (wulo fun ìtẹ́numọ́). Kò sí ipo tí a bá fi silẹ́ láìkọ́','Search:'=>'Wa:','You can return any series that match this search string (matched against series names)'=>'O le gba ẹ̀ka eyikeyi tí o baamu pẹlu ọrọ ìwàásù yìí (ti a fiwe si orukọ ẹ̀ka)','Show other posts in the current series:'=>'Fihan awọn ifiweranṣẹ miiran ninu ẹ̀ka lọwọlọwọ:','Series widget title:'=>'Akọle ẹ̀rọ iṣe jara:','This text will display above other posts in this series.'=>'Àkọsílẹ yìí yóò hàn lórí àwọn àkọsílẹ míì nínú jara yìí.','<strong>This plugin can be deleted.</strong>'=>'<strong>Àwọn àfikún yìí lè parẹ.</strong>','The %1$s already has a parameter indexed with the name: %2$s.'=>'%1$s ti ni paramita kan tó ti n ṣàkóso pẹ̀lú orúkọ: %2$s.','The %1$s method can only be used to register a child of %2$s.'=>'Ọna %1$s lè jẹ́ kí a lo láti forúkọsílẹ ọmọ %2$s kan nìkan.','Unable to retrieve an instance of %1$s. Not found.'=>'Kò le gba àpẹẹrẹ %1$s. Kò rí.','%1$s is not a valid entity (expected: %2$s).'=>'%1$s kì í ṣe ẹ̀dá tó wúlò (tí a nírètí: %2$s).','The "%1$s" file is either missing or could not be read due to permissions. Please ensure that the following path is correct and verify that the file permissions are correct:%2$s %3$s'=>'Fáìlì "%1$s" tàbí kò sí tàbí kò lè ka nitori awọn àṣẹ. Jọwọ jẹ́ kó dájú pé ọ̀nà yìí tọ́ àti ṣàdédé pé àwọn àṣẹ fáìlì náà tọ́:%2$s %3$s','%s does not exist or is not reachable.'=>'%s kò sí tàbí kò lè dé.','Nonce fail.'=>'Aṣiṣe nonce.','The provided object fully qualified class name (%1$s) must implement the %2$s interface.'=>'Orúkọ kilasi tí a fúnni (%1$s) gbọ́dọ̀ ṣe àfihàn %2$s interface.','The given file path (%s) is not readable.'=>'Ọ̀nà fáìlì tí a fúnni (%s) kò lè ka.','An error occurred, please try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan ṣẹlẹ̀, jọwọ tún gbìmọ̀.','The incoming value for %1$s is expected to be a closure.  It was not.'=>'Iye tí ń bọ fún %1$s ni a nírètí láti jẹ́ àkópọ. Kò jẹ́ bẹ́ẹ̀.','Deactivate License'=>'Dákẹ́kọ́ Àṣẹ','Activate License'=>'Ṣíṣe Àṣẹ','License Key successfully activated.'=>'Bọtini Àṣẹ ti ṣe àfikún pẹ̀lú aṣeyọrí.','License Key successfully deactivated.'=>'Bọtini Àṣẹ ti dákẹ́kọ́ pẹ̀lú aṣeyọrí.','The value for %1$s is already set and it is not an array. The %2$s method can only be used to push values to this data element when it is an array.'=>'Iye fún %1$s ti ṣàtúnṣe tẹlẹ̀ àti kò jẹ́ àkópọ. Ọna %2$s lè jẹ́ kí a lo láti fi iye kun àkópọ yìí nígbà tí ó bá jẹ́ àkópọ.','The value for %1$s already exists in the %2$s property. Overrides are not allowed. Since the value of this data is an array, you may want to use the %3$s method to push your value to the array.'=>'Iye fún %1$s ti wà ní %2$s ohun-ini. Àtúnṣeto kì í ṣe àfihàn. Níwọ̀n bí iye data yìí ṣe jẹ́ àkópọ, o lè fẹ́ lo ọ̀nà %3$s láti fi iye rẹ sí àkópọ náà.','The value for %1$s already exists in the %2$s property. Overrides are not allowed.  Consider attaching your value to a different key'=>'Iye fun %1$s ti wa ni tẹlẹ ninu ohun-ini %2$s. Awọn ikolu ko gba laaye. Ronu nipa fifi iye rẹ si bọtini miiran','The namespace for this manifest file has already been registered, choose a namespace other than %s'=>'A ti forukọsilẹ orukọ aaye fun faili manifest yi, yan orukọ aaye miiran ju %s lọ','The provided value for %1$s is not a valid url.  The url provided was: %2$s'=>'Iye ti a pese fun %1$s kii ṣe url to wulo. Url ti a pese ni: %2$s','License Key for %1$s'=>'Bọtini Iwe-aṣẹ fun %1$s','Enter your license key: '=>'Tẹ bọtini iwe-aṣẹ rẹ: ','Expires:'=>'Pari:','taxonomy general nameSeries Categories'=>'Ẹka Awọn jara','taxonomy general nameSeries'=>'Jara','taxonomy singular nameSeries Category'=>'Ẹka Jara','taxonomy singular nameSeries'=>'Jara','series grouping column headerSeries'=>'Jara','series meta box titleSeries'=>'Jara','posts list column headerSeries'=>'Jara','dashboard count labelSeries'=>'Jara' . "\0" . '','top-level admin menu labelSeries'=>'Jara','taxonomy menu nameSeries'=>'Jara','leave the %tokens% as is when translatingThis entry is part %series_part% of %total_posts_in_series% in the series '=>'Iwọnyi jẹ apakan %series_part% ti %total_posts_in_series% ninu jara ','series list titleSeries'=>'Jara','widget title defaultSeries'=>'Jara','widget section labelSeries'=>'Jara']];